# opencode agent/skill definitions. These are prompt text consumed verbatim by
# whichever agent loads them, not rendered documentation — and several are
# vendored from upstream skill repos (`avoid-ai-writing`, `ponytail`), where a
# Prettier rewrite would create permanent divergence from the source being
# synced against. Excluded rather than reformatted.
#
# They were never under `format:check` before because the entire `.opencode/`
# directory was gitignored, so a fresh CI clone simply had no such files; now
# that `.opencode/agents/**` and `.opencode/skills/**` are committed (see
# .gitignore), this entry is what keeps `pnpm run format:check` green.
.opencode/

